# Test that multiple files can be linted in one invocation. Each file's
# results are reported separately, and the presence of errors yields a
# non-zero exit.
! exec awesome-lint testbad.md testbad2.md
stdout 'testbad.md:'
stdout 'testbad2.md:'

# Test JSON array output for multiple files.
exec awesome-lint -j testgood.md testbad.md
stdout '\['
stdout '"filePath": "testgood.md"'
stdout '"filePath": "testbad.md"'

-- testgood.md --
# Awesome List [![Awesome](https://awesome.re/badge.svg)](https://awesome.re)

## Contents

- [Section 1](#section-1)

## Section 1

- [Foo](https://example.com) - A description of foo.
- [Bar](https://example.com/bar) - Another description.
-- testbad.md --
# Awesome List

## Contents

- [Foo](https://example.com) - A description of foo.

## License

MIT
-- testbad2.md --
# Awesome List

## Contents

- [Foo](https://example.com) - A description of foo.

## License

MIT
